      "returnType": "FMaterial&",
      "docs": "Finds the FMaterial to use for rendering this FMaterialRenderProxy.  Will fall back to a default material if needed due to a content error, or async compilation.\nWill always return a valid FMaterial, but unlike GetMaterialWithFallback, FMaterial's shader map may be incomplete"
    },
